          "why": "At constant speed, distance equals speed multiplied by elapsed time.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Convert 54 km/h: 54 ÷ 3.6 = 15 m/s.\nStep 2: Distance = 15 × 20.\nStep 3: Distance = 300 m.",
