          "why": "The time taken is the distance divided by the constant speed.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Distance = 450 m and speed = 5 m/s.\nStep 2: Time = 450 ÷ 5.\nStep 3: Time = 90 s.",
          "hint": "Rearrange distance = speed × time to make time the subject.",
