          "why": "Gravity acts downward throughout the flight, slowing the upward motion until the velocity is momentarily zero.",
          "sol": "Step 1: u = +30 m/s, v = 0 m/s and a = −10 m/s².\nStep 2: 0 = 30 − 10t.\nStep 3: 10t = 30, so t = 3 s.",
