          "why": "Inertia is the tendency of an object to resist changes in its state of motion.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Before braking, the passenger is moving with the bus.\nStep 2: The bus slows quickly.\nStep 3: The passenger's body tends to maintain its previous motion until another force changes it.",
