          "why": "Newton's second law gives resultant force as mass multiplied by acceleration.",
          "sol": "Step 1: m = 6 kg and a = 2 m/s².\nStep 2: F = 6 × 2.\nStep 3: F = 12 N.",
          "hint": "Multiply mass by acceleration.",
          "subject": "physics",
