          "why": "Mass equals density multiplied by volume.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Start with ρ = m/V.\nStep 2: Multiply both sides by V: m = ρV.\nStep 3: Substitute: m = 4 × 15 = 60 g.",
          "hint": "Rearrange density = mass ÷ volume to make mass the subject.",
          "subject": "physics",
