          "why": "The densities are already expressed in the same unit.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Write RD = 3.2 ÷ 1.\nStep 2: Calculate the ratio.\nStep 3: Relative density = 3.2.",
          "hint": "Use water's density as 1 g/cm³.",
          "subject": "physics",
