          "why": "Simple machines alter how force is applied to perform a task.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Identify the task a machine helps perform.\nStep 2: Consider force magnitude, direction, and distance.",
          "hint": "Consider how a machine changes the force or its direction.",
          "subject": "physics",
