          "why": "A larger exposed surface generally increases evaporation rate.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The tray exposes a larger liquid surface.\nStep 2: More particles can escape at the same time.\nStep 3: The evaporation rate generally increases.",
          "hint": "Compare the exposed liquid surface areas.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "temperature_and_thermal_physics",
          "topic": "Factors Affecting Evaporation",
          "conceptId": "physics_temperature_and_thermal_physics_factors_affecting_evaporation",
