          "why": "The displacement increases by 4 m each second.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Change in displacement = 24 − 0 = 24 m.\nStep 2: Time interval = 6 s.\nStep 3: Velocity = 24 ÷ 6.",
          "hint": "Velocity = change in displacement ÷ time.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force_motion_and_mechanics",
          "topic": "Displacement–Time Graphs",
          "conceptId": "physics_force_motion_and_mechanics_displacement_time_graphs",
