          "why": "For equal volumes, the greater mass corresponds to the greater density.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Density = mass ÷ volume.\nStep 2: Both blocks have the same volume.\nStep 3: The block with greater mass has greater density.",
          "hint": "Compare mass when volume is the same.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force_motion_and_mechanics",
