          "sol": "Step 1: The pencil tip contacts the paper.\nStep 2: Friction helps material transfer to the paper.\nStep 3: State the advantage.",
          "hint": "Consider the contact between the pencil and paper.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force_motion_and_mechanics",
