          "why": "The pressure represented by a liquid column is its density multiplied by gravity and height.",
          "sol": "Step 1: P = 1,200 × 10 × 0.5\nStep 2: P = 6,000 Pa",
          "hint": "Use P = ρgh.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "pressure",
          "topic": "Measuring Atmospheric Pressure with a Barometer",
          "conceptId": "physics_pressure_measuring_atmospheric_pressure_with_a_barometer",
