          "why": "A siphon uses a continuous liquid column and a suitable height difference to maintain flow.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The tube is filled or primed with liquid.\nStep 2: The outlet is placed below the liquid surface in the source.\nStep 3: The arrangement allows liquid to flow to the lower level.",
