          "options": [],
          "steps": [
            "Step 1: Both forces act forward.",
            "Step 2: Forces in the same direction are added.",
            "Step 3: R = 10 + 20 = 30 N forward."
          ],
          "why": "Subtraction is used when forces act in opposite directions.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Both forces act forward.\nStep 2: Forces in the same direction are added.\nStep 3: R = 10 + 20 = 30 N forward.",
          "hint": "Check whether the forces oppose one another.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force_motion_and_mechanics",
          "topic": "Resultant Force in the Same Direction",
