          "why": "The box has no vertical acceleration, so the vertical forces balance.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Weight = 5 × 10 = 50 N downward.\nStep 2: The normal reaction balances the weight.\nStep 3: Normal reaction = 50 N upward.",
          "hint": "Vertical forces are balanced.",
          "subject": "physics",
