          "why": "Tension acts along the length of the taut connector.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A taut string or rope transmits a pulling force.\nStep 2: This force is called tension.",
          "hint": "Think of the force transmitted by a taut rope.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force_motion_and_mechanics",
