          "why": "These are the two main forces acting on the resting book.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Earth exerts weight downward.\nStep 2: The table exerts a normal reaction upward.",
          "hint": "Consider gravity and the surface.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force_motion_and_mechanics",
          "topic": "Drawing Force Diagrams",
          "conceptId": "physics_force_motion_and_mechanics_drawing_force_diagrams",
          "skillId": "physics_force_motion_and_mechanics",
