          "why": "Mechanical advantage divided by velocity ratio gives efficiency as a fraction.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Efficiency = (4/5) × 100%\nStep 2: Efficiency = 80%",
          "hint": "Use efficiency = (MA/VR) × 100%.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "work_energy_power_machines",
