          "sol": "Step 1: Recall that cathode rays consist of electrons.\nStep 2: Identify that the electrons are moving.\nStep 3: Relate motion to kinetic energy.",
          "hint": "Focus on the core principle of Energy and Momentum of Cathode Rays.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "cathode_rays",
          "topic": "Energy and Momentum of Cathode Rays",
          "conceptId": "physics_cathode_rays_energy_and_momentum_of_cathode_rays",
          "skillId": "physics_cathode_rays",
          "subskillId": "physics_cathode_rays_q1"
