          "sol": "Step 1: v = √(2KE/m)\nStep 2: v = √[(2 × 8.0 × 10⁻¹⁸)/(9.11 × 10⁻³¹)]\nStep 3: v ≈ 4.19 × 10⁶ m/s",
          "hint": "Use v = √(2KE/m).",
          "subject": "physics",
