          "why": "Period is the reciprocal of frequency.",
          "sol": "Step 1: f = 25 Hz.\nStep 2: T = 1/f.\nStep 3: T = 1/25 = 0.04 s.",
          "hint": "Use T = 1/f.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "waves",
          "topic": "Period of a Wave",
          "conceptId": "physics_waves_period_of_a_wave",
          "skillId": "physics_waves",
