          "why": "The speed of light in a vacuum is approximately 3.0 × 10⁸ m/s.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The speed of light in a vacuum is represented by c.\nStep 2: Its approximate value is 300,000,000 m/s.",
          "hint": "Use the standard value in metres per second.",
          "subject": "physics",
