          "sol": "Step 1: W = mg.\nStep 2: Substitute m = 7 kg and g = 10 N/kg.\nStep 3: W = 7 × 10 = 70 N.",
          "hint": "Use W = mg.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force",
          "topic": "Calculating Weight",
          "conceptId": "physics_force_calculating_weight",
          "skillId": "physics_force",
          "subskillId": "physics_force_q1"
