          "why": "Friction opposes relative sliding or the tendency to slide between contacting surfaces.",
          "sol": "Step 1: The block's sliding direction is to the right.\nStep 2: Friction acts opposite to that sliding.\nStep 3: Therefore, friction acts to the left.",
