          "sol": "Step 1: Take right as the positive direction.\nStep 2: Resultant = 20 N − 7 N = 13 N.\nStep 3: The larger force acts right, so the resultant is 13 N right.",
          "hint": "Opposing forces are subtracted.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "force",
          "topic": "Resultant Force with Friction",
