          "why": "For the same work, completing it in less time requires greater average power.",
          "sol": "Step 1: P(A) = 600/3 = 200 W.\nStep 2: P(B) = 600/6 = 100 W.\nStep 3: Machine A has greater average power.",
          "hint": "Calculate P = W/t for both machines.",
          "subject": "physics",
          "chapter": "work_energy_power",
          "topic": "Comparing Power",
          "conceptId": "physics_work_energy_power_comparing_power",
          "skillId": "physics_work_energy_power",
