          "steps": [
            "Step 1: Supply voltage equals the sum of the drops.",
            "Step 2: V = 4 + 6.",
            "Step 3: V = 10 V."
          ],
          "why": "The supply voltage accounts for the energy transferred across all series components.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Supply voltage equals the sum of the drops.\nStep 2: V = 4 + 6.\nStep 3: V = 10 V.",
          "hint": "Add the voltage drops.",
