          "why": "Higher viscosity corresponds to greater resistance to flow.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Honey flows less readily than water.\nStep 2: Viscosity measures resistance to flow.\nStep 3: Therefore, honey has the higher viscosity.",
          "hint": "The more resistant liquid has the higher viscosity.",
          "subject": "physics",
